{"id":"77af8d422f1b33a0","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Faithful Functor","display":"df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor — ZFC Cat2 Faithful Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor — ZFC Cat2 Faithful Functor","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor — ZFC Cat2 Faithful Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F_0,F_1\\in V\">\\(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F_0,F_1\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\">\\(F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=(O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C)\">\\(\\mathcal C=(O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=(O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D)\">\\(\\mathcal D=(O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D)\\)</span> are category data</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category.md\">../batch04/58-df-category.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}faithful\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists F_0,F_1,O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nF=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(F_0,O_C,O_D)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(F_1,M_C,M_D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in M_C\\;\\bigl(\ns_D(F_1(f))=F_0(s_C(f))\\land t_D(F_1(f))=F_0(t_C(f))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in O_C\\;\\bigl(F_1(e_C(A))=e_D(F_0(A))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f,g\\in M_C\\;\\Bigl(\nt_C(f)=s_C(g)\\to\nF_1(\\circ_C(\\langle g,f\\rangle))\n=\\circ_D(\\langle F_1(g),F_1(f)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A,B\\in O_C\\;\\forall f,g\\in M_C\\;\\Bigl(\ns_C(f)=A\\land t_C(f)=B\\land s_C(g)=A\\land t_C(g)=B\\land F_1(f)=F_1(g)\n\\to f=g\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}faithful\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists F_0,F_1,O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nF=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(F_0,O_C,O_D)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(F_1,M_C,M_D)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in M_C\\;\\bigl(\ns_D(F_1(f))=F_0(s_C(f))\\land t_D(F_1(f))=F_0(t_C(f))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in O_C\\;\\bigl(F_1(e_C(A))=e_D(F_0(A))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall f,g\\in M_C\\;\\Bigl(\nt_C(f)=s_C(g)\\to\nF_1(\\circ_C(\\langle g,f\\rangle))\n=\\circ_D(\\langle F_1(g),F_1(f)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A,B\\in O_C\\;\\forall f,g\\in M_C\\;\\Bigl(\ns_C(f)=A\\land t_C(f)=B\\land s_C(g)=A\\land t_C(g)=B\\land F_1(f)=F_1(g)\n\\to f=g\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Faithfulness is injectivity of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_1\">\\(F_1\\)</span> on each typed hom-set; both components and both composition functions are applied using their registered set-function conventions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-category.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D,F_0,F_1\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=(O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=(O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}faithful\\text{-}functor}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(F,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\\exists F_0,F_1,O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C,O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nF=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathcal C=\\langle O_C,M_C,s_C,t_C,\\circ_C,e_C\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal D=\\langle O_D,M_D,s_D,t_D,\\circ_D,e_D\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Function}(F_0,O_C,O_D)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(F_1,M_C,M_D)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall f\\in M_C\\;\\bigl(\ns_D(F_1(f))=F_0(s_C(f))\\land t_D(F_1(f))=F_0(t_C(f))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in O_C\\;\\bigl(F_1(e_C(A))=e_D(F_0(A))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall f,g\\in M_C\\;\\Bigl(\nt_C(f)=s_C(g)\\to\nF_1(\\circ_C(\\langle g,f\\rangle))\n=\\circ_D(\\langle F_1(g),F_1(f)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A,B\\in O_C\\;\\forall f,g\\in M_C\\;\\Bigl(\ns_C(f)=A\\land t_C(f)=B\\land s_C(g)=A\\land t_C(g)=B\\land F_1(f)=F_1(g)\n\\to f=g\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F_1","display":false}],"bytes":2086,"backlinks":[{"id":"6477de4a04201a72","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S$ (faithful-functor predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]])"},{"id":"f12377a238966b6a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCat2FaithfulFunctor}_S(U,\\mathcal C,\\mathbf{Set})$ (faithful-functor predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1579","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-faithful-functor]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","a87b7e1119b63b2c","36d7463d215be751"]}